[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13742.389, "timestamp": "03:49:02", "text": "东西，而且我也对那玩意儿上瘾了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13745.79, "timestamp": "03:49:05", "text": "安排一场比赛。为什么是我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13748.08, "timestamp": "03:49:08", "text": "上瘾了吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13750.03, "timestamp": "03:49:10", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13753.11, "timestamp": "03:49:13", "text": "是的。就像……当我还是……的时候"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13755.67, "timestamp": "03:49:15", "text": "Minecraft 当内部 Minecraft"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13757.75, "timestamp": "03:49:17", "text": "这项赛事是由休斯顿太空人队举办的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13759.99, "timestamp": "03:49:19", "text": "是太空人队的活动，对吧？废墟的诞生。什么时候"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13762.389, "timestamp": "03:49:22", "text": "当时，我完全沉浸其中。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13765.99, "timestamp": "03:49:25", "text": "我的世界。我当时更加努力地工作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13769.189, "timestamp": "03:49:29", "text": "每晚都更加努力，睡得也异常艰难。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13771.269, "timestamp": "03:49:31", "text": "时间安排被打乱了。和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13774.389, "timestamp": "03:49:34", "text": "现在这款游戏来了，我就想，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13777.15, "timestamp": "03:49:37", "text": "啊，真好，真棒！"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13783.429, "timestamp": "03:49:43", "text": "但我很高兴自己享受这一切。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13787.269, "timestamp": "03:49:47", "text": "与其说是玩游戏，不如说是感到筋疲力尽。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13789.59, "timestamp": "03:49:49", "text": "我觉得我慢慢开始明白了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13794.229, "timestamp": "03:49:54", "text": "因为我，我被从第一阶段的计划中烧毁了。"}]